# === PowerLine Challenge (PLC) monorepo ===

# Dependencies (dev-only tooling under cartridges; never deployed)
node_modules/

# OS / editor / OneDrive cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
*.tmp

# Oversized uncompressed source audio — GitHub rejects any file over 100MB.
# POLICY: compress before committing. Web Audio decodeAudioData handles OGG/MP3/Opus/
# FLAC natively, and the loaders build URLs by filename, so the container is a free
# choice — no code change is needed to swap a stem's format.
# Resolved 2026-09-08: Background1.wav (241 MiB, 32-bit float, 11:56) was the only
# entry here. It is now files/music/Background1.ogg (8.9 MiB, OGG Vorbis, byte-for-byte
# the same 31,588,605 frames), wired as the menu bed and COMMITTED, so this rule had
# nothing left to ignore.
# Deliberately NOT replaced with a blanket *.wav rule: the SFX library is WAV-based
# and 12 stems are tracked, so a wildcard would silently hide legitimate new ones.
# Add a specific path here if another oversized master ever lands.

# === C64 disk library (Game/disks/) ==========================================
# 🚨 THIS REPO IS PUBLIC AND HAS NO PRE-PUSH HOOK. Disk images committed here
# would be published to github.com and to GitHub Pages, permanently — deleting
# them later does not undo it. The folder is user-curated on each machine and
# travels EMPTY on purpose; an empty library is a normal state the hub handles.
# 🚫 Do not un-ignore this. See Game/disks/README.md.
Game/disks/*
!Game/disks/README.md

# EmulatorJS self-hosted core data (Game/cat/emulator/data/).
# Third-party GPL build artefacts, ~10-15MB, fetched per-machine rather than
# vendored — see Game/cat/emulator/README.md for the one command that gets it.
Game/cat/emulator/data/
